// The system's connectors — the named ports its edge blocks reach the outside world
// through. Each is declared once and referenced from the system definition via
// `.From(...)` (extractor source) or `.To(...)` (loader destination).
//
// A connector declares only its deployed transport shape (e.g. `Transport.Sftp()`);
// the shape is value-free — addresses, credentials, and paths are environment-owned
// deployment configuration. Local F5 runs never touch the deployed transport: the
// development definition resolves each connector to a folder under this project via
// `development.Files(...).RootPath(...)`.
//
// `intropy sys create` regenerates this file from the sibling components' scaffold
// records — validate edits afterwards with `dotnet run -- check`.
public static class Connectors
